# Data Lake Notes

Storage concepts for handling large-scale data.

## Topics

- Data Lake  
  Central storage for all types of data.  
  Example: ADLS storing raw and processed data.  
  Real-life: First landing zone for enterprise data.

- ADLS Gen2  
  Azure storage optimized for analytics.  
  Real-life: Used with Spark and ADF.

- Layered Architecture  
  Raw, curated, and processed layers.  
  Example: Raw data cleaned into curated layer.  
  Real-life: Simplifies debugging and reprocessing.

- File Formats  
  CSV, JSON, Parquet.  
  Example: Parquet for analytics performance.  
  Real-life: Parquet used for Spark jobs.

- Partitioning  
  Organizing data by columns like date.  
  Real-life: Faster queries on large datasets.
